  id: q2
  title: Self-defense
  description: A husband, wife, and their son had never been to war, nor had they
    ever held weapons, but they lived in a rather dangerous place. A bandit camp
    was located in the forest near them, and they often robbed the villagers. These
    people asked them to bring a couple of <b>Spiked clubs (x3)</b> for self-defense.
  descriptionCompleted: The family received their weapon. Let it not be a guarantee
    of safety, but with it, they feel much calmer. They don't really have money to
    pay me back, but they gave me a useful book as a token of gratitude.
